<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Resolute half year net profit falls.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Resolute half year net profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1996-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to December 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    14.65 vs 20.08</p>
<p>    Net				     15.06 vs 20.08</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     1.00 vs 3.00</p>
<p>    Sales				   88.65 vs 71.32</p>
<p>    Other income			   4.72 vs 9.23</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    8.40 vs 15.60</p>
<p>Dividend is unfranked</p>
<p>Pay date April 25</p>
<p>Reg date April 4  </p>
<p>    Tax			     credit 0.56 vs nil</p>
<p>    Interest				 1.36 vs 0.82</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  12.97 vs 10.29</p>
<p>    Minorities			     0.15 vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Resolute Ltd is a gold miner.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
